"below will be replaced:</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Wpisóny tuwò tekst bãdze brëkòwóny do wëskrzëniwaniô fùl datumów. Tekst "
"mòże zamëkac w se pòdóné niżi céchë:</p>"

#: localetime.cpp:555
msgid ""
"<p>The text in this textbox will be used to format short dates. For "
"instance, this is used when listing files. The sequences below will be "
"replaced:</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Wpisóny tuwò tekst bãdze brëkòwóny do wëskrzëniwaniô krótczich datumów. "
"Tekst mòże zamëkac w se pòdóné niżi céchë:</p>"

#: localetime.cpp:562
msgid ""
"<p>This option determines which day will be considered as the first one of "
"the week.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Na òptacëjô òpisëje, jaczi dzéń je trzëmóny za pierszi w tidzéniu.</p>"

#: localetime.cpp:567
msgid ""
"<p>This option determines which day will be considered as the first working "
"day of the week.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Na òptacëjô òpisëje, jaczi dzéń je trzëmóny za pierszi robòczi dzéń w "
"tidzéniu.</p>"

#: localetime.cpp:572
msgid ""
"<p>This option determines which day will be considered as the last working "
"day of the week.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Na òptacëjô òpisëje, jaczi dzéń je trzëmóny za pierszi robòczi dzéń w "
"tidzéniu.</p>"

#: localetime.cpp:577
msgid ""
"<p>This option determines which day will be considered as the day of the "
"week for religious observance.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Na òptacëjô òpisëje, jaczi dzéń je trzëmóny za pierszi robòczi dzéń w "
"tidzéniu.</p>"

#: localetime.cpp:584
msgid ""
"<p>This option determines whether possessive form of month names should be "
"used in dates.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Na òptacëjô òpisëje, czë w datumie nót je brëkòwac zjinaczonégò miona "
"miesąca (np. 1 séwnika).</p>"

